  script: "# PLACEHOLDER. Unlocks when \"john-first-word\" is done AND John's loyalty is 10 or more.\n# Finishing it gives John a lasting Productivity x1.1 bonus (the chapter's Rewards: a Buff).\n\nJohn: Can I tell you something? (placeholder)\n[if loyalty >= 20] John: I've never felt this at home anywhere. (placeholder: only above loyalty 20)\n[if loyalty < 20] John: This place is starting to grow on me. (placeholder)\nJohn: I'll work harder for this town. (placeholder)\n"
